Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.18,0:00:23.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.56,0:00:27.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sepertinya banyak yang terjadi saat aku pergi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.81,0:00:30.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tuan Hakubi membalikkan\Ntransformasi Tuan Mao,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.82,0:00:32.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan kami dalam bahaya besar.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.03,0:00:35.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kami berhasil membuka segel Air\Nyang mengikat Tuan Hyakka
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.41,0:00:38.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan dia bisa mengusir Tuan Hakubi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.24,0:00:41.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagus, Hyakka.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.58,0:00:42.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tunjukkan rasa hormat!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.87,0:00:48.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi, apa itu berarti\Nkau mematahkan segel Air, Otoya?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.46,0:00:51.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya. Aku…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.92,0:00:54.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}shikigami yang diciptakan\Ndari boneka manusia.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.55,0:00:57.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Manusia adalah milik elemen Tanah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.35,0:01:00.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tanah mengalahkan Air, jadi…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.89,0:01:03.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}meski aku hanya shikigami,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.51,0:01:05.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kukira aku bisa melakukannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.06,0:01:08.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Luar biasa, Otoya!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.65,0:01:11.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hei! Kenapa kau tak memuji keahlianku?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.79,0:02:54.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa yang harus kulakukan?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.84,0:02:59.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku datang untuk memberitahunya\Nbahwa Byoki datang dan bicara denganku.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.47,0:03:01.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selain itu,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.01,0:03:05.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}untuk memberitahunya bagaimana Nona Sana\Nmemuntahkan kutukan hitam dari mulutnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.56,0:03:09.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Agak sulit untuk membahasnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.81,0:03:12.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku merasa akan menjelek-jelekkan dia.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.44,0:03:17.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dokter Mao! Tolong rawat dia!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.24,0:03:19.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.86,0:03:23.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hei, Mao! Ada pasien darurat!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.32,0:03:25.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tuan Hyakka! Jangan bangunkan dia.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.62,0:03:30.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau mengalami fraktur halus.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.12,0:03:32.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini sesuatu yang bisa kuobati sendiri.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.04,0:03:33.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sudah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.09,0:03:35.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jaga dirimu.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.92,0:03:39.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau buka?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.38,0:03:41.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Syukurlah! Kau tutup kemarin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.13,0:03:43.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Seluruh wajahku berjerawat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.30,0:03:47.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tidak berselera makan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.31,0:03:48.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku akan memberimu obat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.60,0:03:49.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.81,0:03:51.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}- Leherku terasa kaku…\N- Oh…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.10,0:03:54.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Satu di sini, di sini, dan di sini…\NDan di sini.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.95,0:04:03.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini bintil.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.49,0:04:05.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau boleh pergi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.45,0:04:08.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bisnis berkembang.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.74,0:04:10.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Biar kubantu, Otoya.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.25,0:04:11.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku menghargainya, Nona Nanoka.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.96,0:04:14.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bisakah kau membantu pasien\Nyang menunggu di sana?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.75,0:04:17.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kepalaku sakit sekali.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.70,0:04:19.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini cara yang buruk untuk memulai!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.80,0:04:21.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku hanya perlu menariknya, bukan?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.80,0:04:23.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Permisi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.26,0:04:25.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benar-benar tersangkut.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.26,0:04:27.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}- Kau menyakitiku!\N- Kau payah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.47,0:04:28.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}- Minggir.\N- Hei.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.56,0:04:30.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aduh!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.93,0:04:32.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Satu… dua…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.73,0:04:34.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lepas!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.11,0:04:39.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}- Dia menghindarinya!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.82,0:04:41.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mao! Kau baik-baik saja?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.11,0:04:42.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukankah dia sudah bangun?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.20,0:04:44.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia tertidur lelap.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.61,0:04:45.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak mungkin.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.91,0:04:48.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Berapa lama kau akan terus tidur, berengsek?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.54,0:04:50.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Diam.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.96,0:04:56.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mantra apa itu?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.38,0:04:58.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu mungkin penghalang.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.92,0:05:04.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia tertidur lelap.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.30,0:05:05.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau pasti bercanda.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.18,0:05:07.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa dia selalu seperti ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.72,0:05:11.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Begini…\NAku tidak pernah memaksanya bangun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.02,0:05:13.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia pasti kelelahan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.85,0:05:18.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mungkin tidur adalah\Nsatu-satunya saat dia merasa damai.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.86,0:05:22.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku kasihan kepadanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.82,0:05:25.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baiklah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.03,0:05:27.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mari terus bekerja!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.99,0:05:29.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita hanya punya beberapa pasien lagi!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.08,0:05:31.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nona Nanoka, kau baik sekali.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.99,0:05:33.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sial.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.08,0:05:35.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dokter Mao!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.75,0:05:39.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}- Kami berbagi hotpot.\N- Lalu mulai sakit perut!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.84,0:05:41.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sekelompok besar.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.71,0:05:44.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hei! Jangan muntah di lantai!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.80,0:05:46.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Di mana embernya?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.60,0:05:59.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidurku nyenyak.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.77,0:06:01.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selamat pagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.98,0:06:02.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selamat pagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.07,0:06:11.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.83,0:06:18.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tidak sempat memberi tahu Mao
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.50,0:06:19.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tentang Nona Sana.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.54,0:06:21.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dan…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.21,0:06:27.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benarkah kucing ada di luar alam Onmyodo?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.47,0:06:28.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tunggu, apa maksudmu?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.97,0:06:31.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya. Hakubi berengsek itu mengatakannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.80,0:06:35.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia bilang kucing bukan anggota Lima Elemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.85,0:06:36.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sebenarnya,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.10,0:06:38.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}saat Tuan Mao berubah,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.52,0:06:41.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tidak memengaruhinya.\Nmantra Onmyodo Tuan Hakubi
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.11,0:06:43.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Di luar dunia Onmyodo…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.65,0:06:47.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi, kucing adalah makhluk istimewa?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.90,0:06:48.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku akan menyelidikinya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.91,0:06:53.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hubungan antara Onmyodo dan kucing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.79,0:07:00.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak ada kemajuan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.42,0:07:04.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nanoka, apa yang kau lihat sepanjang pagi?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.13,0:07:04.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.50,0:07:08.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Shiraha mengamatimu sepanjang pagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.01,0:07:09.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.43,0:07:12.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau bisa mengandalkanku.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.14,0:07:15.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baiklah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.64,0:07:18.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pertama-tama,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.68,0:07:22.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Onmyodo berakar\Ndalam filosofi alam Tiongkok kuno.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.60,0:07:24.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu berdasarkan gagasan bahwa semuanya ada
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.90,0:07:26.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}melalui harmoni dua kekuatan berlawanan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.48,0:07:27.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}melalui harmoni dua kekuatan berlawanan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.82,0:07:29.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itulah Filosofi Yin-Yang.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.53,0:07:32.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada juga gagasan bahwa semuanya terdiri
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.03,0:07:35.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dari lima unsur dasar\Nyang saling memengaruhi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.28,0:07:36.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Filosofi Lima Elemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.87,0:07:39.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Onmyodo adalah perpaduan kedua filosofi itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.71,0:07:42.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kucing berasal dari Mesir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.79,0:07:47.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Saat Teori Lima Elemen Yin-Yang\Npertama dikembangkan,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.55,0:07:49.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kucing tampaknya belum mencapai Tiongkok.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.26,0:07:50.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.42,0:07:51.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.55,0:07:54.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}shio Tiongkok adalah bagian\Ndari Teori Lima Elemen, bukan?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.18,0:07:56.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.35,0:07:58.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku selalu penasaran kenapa
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.43,0:08:00.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tidak ada kucing di shio Tiongkok.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.73,0:08:01.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi, aku menyelidikinya.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.19,0:08:04.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tampaknya, kucing ditipu oleh tikus
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.27,0:08:07.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan melewatkan hari\Nsaat hewan dipilih untuk shio.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.11,0:08:10.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu yang kubaca.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.57,0:08:12.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi, karena itu tidak ada kucing di shio?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.57,0:08:17.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Cerita itu hanya ada di Jepang.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.37,0:08:19.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mungkin itu ditambahkan kemudian.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.00,0:08:21.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia punya jawaban untuk semuanya!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.79,0:08:26.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa? Apa itu artinya\Nkucing tidak pernah dimasukkan
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.04,0:08:29.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}ke sistem Onmyodo?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.17,0:08:33.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kucing baru tiba di Jepang\Nsetelah era Asuka.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.54,0:08:36.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mereka datang bersama masuknya ajaran Buddha
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.47,0:08:39.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}untuk melindungi kitab berharga dari tikus.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.02,0:08:42.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pada era Heian,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.52,0:08:44.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}catatan menunjukkan bahwa kucing dipelihara
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.48,0:08:46.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}di Istana Kekaisaran\Nsebagai peliharaan berharga.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.31,0:08:48.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.94,0:08:50.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi, itu artinya Klan Goko
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.86,0:08:53.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}pasti keluarga yang cukup bergengsi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.95,0:08:56.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dan aku menemukan ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.37,0:08:58.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Entah apa ini berkaitan\Ndengan Onmyodo, tapi…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.49,0:09:01.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selama dinasti Sui,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.50,0:09:04.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}saat Jepang mengirim utusan ke Tiongkok,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.08,0:09:07.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maogui sangat populer di sana.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.29,0:09:10.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu kutukan yang digunakan\Nuntuk mengendalikan kodoku kucing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.30,0:09:16.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maogui diterjemahkan menjadi apa\Ndalam bahasa Jepang?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.09,0:09:18.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iblis kucing
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.64,0:09:19.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}atau Byoki.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.85,0:09:21.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada di internet?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.56,0:09:26.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}"Byoki merasuki orang,\Nmelahap organ dalam mereka,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.31,0:09:28.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan mencuri kekayaan orang\Nyang dibunuhnya."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.15,0:09:31.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}"Akibatnya,\Ntuannya perlahan menjadi kaya."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.03,0:09:33.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini sejenis kodoku, mirip dengan Enmi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.78,0:09:38.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kaisar Sui melarang penggunaan Maogui.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.45,0:09:40.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Klan yang diketahui menggunakan Maogui
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.20,0:09:42.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dipenjara selama empat generasi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.58,0:09:46.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Meski begitu, orang-orang\Ntidak pernah berhenti menggunakannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.17,0:09:49.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hmm. Kalau begitu,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.09,0:09:52.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Byoki sangat cocok untuk Klan Goko,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.01,0:09:55.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}karena mereka penjaga seni rahasia Jugondo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.09,0:09:58.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi Klan Goko runtuh
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.93,0:10:01.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}karena tidak bisa mengendalikan Byoki?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.73,0:10:06.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada onmyoji yang tidak suka kucing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.44,0:10:10.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Klan yang lebih tradisional\Ncenderung menghindari mereka.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.61,0:10:14.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi pria itu, Hakubi…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.03,0:10:17.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dari penampilannya,\Ndia sebenarnya cukup idealis.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.32,0:10:24.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Guru memberitahuku bahwa Maogui\Nsudah ada sejak zaman kuno.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.20,0:10:26.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia tidak pernah memberitahuku alasan
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.12,0:10:31.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kucing itu, Haimaru, dibawa ke kediaman,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.63,0:10:36.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi aku curiga pada akhirnya dia berniat\Nmengendalikan Haimaru sebagai Byoki.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.22,0:10:40.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tampaknya, Tuan Hakubi memiliki
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.39,0:10:41.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kesimpulan yang sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.68,0:10:42.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.72,0:10:45.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi yang selalu menggangguku adalah
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.35,0:10:49.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kapan Haimaru menjadi Byoki?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.31,0:10:54.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi bukankah kau sudah memberitahuku?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.61,0:10:58.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mokuzu, salah satu pelayan di kediaman,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.82,0:11:01.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}melempar Haimaru ke dalam lubang kodoku.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.74,0:11:04.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu yang dikatakan Mokuzu,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.04,0:11:06.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan mungkin itu yang dia yakini,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.62,0:11:09.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi bagaimanapun aku memikirkannya,\Nitu tidak masuk akal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.54,0:11:13.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Haimaru tidak akan membiarkan siapa pun\Nkecuali Nona Sana dan aku
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.79,0:11:14.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}mendekatinya,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.25,0:11:18.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi dia tidak pernah mencoba kabur\Nsaat Mokuzu membawanya pergi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.38,0:11:20.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lalu
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.43,0:11:23.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dia membunuh dan melahap anjing liar\Ndan babi hutan di dalam lubang kodoku.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.01,0:11:27.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa kucing biasa mampu\Nmelakukan hal seperti itu?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.60,0:11:31.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi, Haimaru
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.48,0:11:36.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}mungkin sudah menjadi Byoki\Njauh sebelum itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.28,0:11:38.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itulah yang kuyakini.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.12,0:11:48.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dokter yang dihormati?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.37,0:11:52.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya. Awalnya semua orang senang.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.75,0:11:56.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mereka bilang dia akan mengobati\Nluka paling serius secara gratis.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.38,0:11:58.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Seperti Mao?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.88,0:12:00.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Silakan lanjutkan, Tenko.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.13,0:12:03.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Orang-orang yang lukanya sudah sembuh
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.97,0:12:06.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}menghilang beberapa bulan kemudian.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.22,0:12:10.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sebagian besar dari mereka\Nadalah pria dalam kondisi prima,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.68,0:12:13.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}jadi beberapa orang berpikir\Nmereka memilih untuk menghilang.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.52,0:12:15.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi tempo hari,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.90,0:12:18.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}orang yang dirawat oleh dokter itu…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.36,0:12:24.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu pria yang terjepit di bawah kayu
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.99,0:12:27.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan hampir kehilangan lengannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.99,0:12:30.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini bahkan belum sepuluh hari,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.66,0:12:32.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi dia sudah bangun.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.92,0:12:38.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia tiba-tiba pingsan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.00,0:12:41.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dan yang tersisa hanya pakaian\Ndan peralatannya, dan…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.92,0:12:44.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}setumpuk tanah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.34,0:12:48.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa? Maksudmu tubuhnya\Nberubah menjadi tanah?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.35,0:12:54.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jika kau mencari Dokter Domon, dia pindah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.73,0:12:55.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pagi ini, tanpa pemberitahuan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.69,0:12:59.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau tahu perawatan apa\Nyang dia gunakan pada pasiennya?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.15,0:13:03.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya. Itu semacam tapal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.99,0:13:06.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia selalu menggiling sesuatu.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.57,0:13:08.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Setiap kali seseorang yang terluka\Ndibawa ke sini,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.99,0:13:10.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dia akan menutup lukanya dengan obat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.70,0:13:12.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Beberapa hari kemudian,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.00,0:13:14.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}lukanya akan sembuh total.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.37,0:13:17.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu seperti sihir.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.34,0:13:22.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa obat itu terbuat dari tanah?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.88,0:13:24.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tanah?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.72,0:13:34.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pria ini sangat membenci Sengoku-Dayu
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.94,0:13:36.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}hingga berusaha mengutuknya sampai mati.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.85,0:13:38.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Di sana!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.73,0:13:40.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi, dia memanggil dewa iblis.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.86,0:13:45.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi pria malang itu malah tercabik-cabik.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.12,0:13:55.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau sudah pulang.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.66,0:13:59.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau membuang jasadnya sesuai perintahku?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.46,0:14:01.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya, Tuan Sengoku-Dayu.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.55,0:14:04.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mao! Kau sudah besar sekarang!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.34,0:14:07.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Daigo…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.22,0:14:12.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tinggal di rumah untuk anak telantar.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.31,0:14:14.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Seperti namanya,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.85,0:14:16.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}itu rumah untuk anak telantar.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.35,0:14:19.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Anak-anak yang diculik,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.61,0:14:24.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dijual ke pedagang,\Natau yatim piatu juga tinggal di sana.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.94,0:14:26.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rumah untuk anak telantar?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.74,0:14:33.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tinggal di sana sejak kecil.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.20,0:14:35.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi, sejujurnya,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.45,0:14:37.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku bahkan tidak tahu\Nsiapa aku atau dari mana asalku.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.50,0:14:42.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Uh… Aku bahkan tidak tahu\Nharus berkata apa.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.30,0:14:47.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Saat berusia enam atau tujuh tahun,\Nkami dibawa
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.84,0:14:50.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}ke lapangan terbuka di tengah malam.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.01,0:14:55.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kami ditanya,\N"Kau bisa melihat mereka atau tidak?"
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.99,0:15:14.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku bisa melihat mereka.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.62,0:15:20.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mulai keesokan harinya,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.12,0:15:23.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku diberi pakaian yang lebih bagus
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.59,0:15:25.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan lebih banyak makanan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.34,0:15:28.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mereka yang menjawab\Ntidak bisa melihat apa pun,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.55,0:15:29.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dijual di suatu tempat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.72,0:15:34.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tuan rumahnya, Sengoku-Dayu,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.47,0:15:36.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tahu berbagai mantra misterius.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.14,0:15:39.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Setiap hari, dia mengajariku\Ncara menulis jimat kutukan
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.64,0:15:41.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan membuat segel tangan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.73,0:15:46.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Daigo sudah berlatih\Nbeberapa tahun sebelum aku.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.36,0:15:51.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lihat aku.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.37,0:16:01.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hei, Mao.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.75,0:16:04.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pernah dengar Klan Goko?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.38,0:16:06.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.00,0:16:09.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mereka bilang jika kau terpilih\Nuntuk bergabung dengan Klan Goko,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.67,0:16:12.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}mereka akan mengajarimu mantra\Nyang lebih menakjubkan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.01,0:16:15.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lalu aku bisa membantu\Nmembentuk dunia dari balik layar.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.05,0:16:17.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu kediaman yang luar biasa
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.76,0:16:20.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan aku akan menjalani hidup\Nyang jauh lebih baik daripada di sini.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.23,0:16:23.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu akan seperti surga.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.82,0:16:28.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku akan berlatih sekeras mungkin.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.86,0:16:30.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Suatu hari, aku akan masuk Klan Goko.\NAku bersumpah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.49,0:16:33.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Menepati janjinya,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.32,0:16:38.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}untuk bergabung dengan Klan Goko.\Nbeberapa tahun kemudian, Daigo terpilih
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.62,0:16:44.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi, rumah untuk anak telantar\Ntempatmu dibesarkan
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.71,0:16:46.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}pada dasarnya adalah\Ntim peternakan untuk Klan Goko?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.59,0:16:49.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Peter… Apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.30,0:16:51.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf. Maksudku seperti anak di bawah umur.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.55,0:16:53.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benar.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.88,0:16:56.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia tidak mengerti, tapi dia setuju saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.35,0:17:00.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lalu, beberapa tahun kemudian,\Nsetelah dia menjalani pelatihan,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.93,0:17:02.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Daigo kembali untukku.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.69,0:17:06.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku memberi tahu Guru tentangmu.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.27,0:17:08.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia bilang…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.73,0:17:12.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ah… ya, aku ingat anak itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.90,0:17:16.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Beberapa tahun lalu,\Nsaat ritual Gua Tulang Putih.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.36,0:17:17.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia anak
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.91,0:17:20.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}yang berhasil keluar dari labirin alami\Ndengan mudah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.61,0:17:22.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ah, itu kau.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.25,0:17:25.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Anak dari rumah anak telantar.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.59,0:17:29.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Daigo.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.59,0:17:33.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Siapa itu? Apa dia baru?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.42,0:17:35.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya, Nona Sana.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.26,0:17:37.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia seperti adik bagiku.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.98,0:17:49.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Astaga.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.57,0:17:55.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa? Haimaru tidak pernah\Nseramah itu denganku.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.16,0:17:59.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terkejut?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.62,0:18:02.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Makhluk ini bernama kucing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.20,0:18:05.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh… Aku belum pernah melihatnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.46,0:18:09.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku ditugaskan menjadi pelayan Guru.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.75,0:18:13.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku menemani Guru saat dia bepergian\Ndi antara tempat latihan
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.34,0:18:16.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}untuk masing-masing Lima Elemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.39,0:18:21.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku melihat para penyihir berlatih,\Ntermasuk Daigo dan penyihir Tanah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.76,0:18:24.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Siapa yang akan menguji kemampuan mereka\Nmelawan shikigami-ku?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.10,0:18:27.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.85,0:18:29.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Daigo. Ini di luar kemampuanmu.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.02,0:18:32.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau bukan siapa-siapa\Ndari rumah anak telantar!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.09,0:19:01.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sialan kau!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.43,0:19:06.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini bukan hanya kekuatan energi elemennya.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.73,0:19:09.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Daigo telah mengkultivasi\Nenergi Tanah yang luar biasa.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.60,0:19:12.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalian semua harus mengikuti contohnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.36,0:19:13.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}- Ya, Guru!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.11,0:19:20.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Daigo, kau…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.70,0:19:24.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Daigo seharusnya menjalani mimpinya.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.66,0:19:28.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bakatnya diakui oleh Klan Goko\Nyang sudah lama dia kagumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.46,0:19:30.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.01,0:19:41.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maksudmu Daigo mungkin Dokter Domon?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.05,0:19:45.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak. Banyak penyihir Tanah tahu
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.56,0:19:47.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}cara merawat orang dengan obat Tanah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.39,0:19:50.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Otoya.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.52,0:19:52.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini, Tuan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.81,0:19:54.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa itu, Otoya?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.40,0:19:55.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini tanah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.15,0:19:57.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku mengumpulkan ini dari tempat
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.61,0:19:59.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}di mana pria\Nyang berubah menjadi tanah jatuh.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.75,0:20:11.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jika pria bernama Domon itu
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.50,0:20:13.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}masih memiliki obat Tanah yang sama,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.38,0:20:16.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}jimat kupu-kupu akan memberi tahu kita.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.17,0:20:20.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu sangat berguna.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.89,0:20:25.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa aku memilih tanah yang salah?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.39,0:20:29.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku menyiapkannya persis\Nseperti perintah orang itu, tapi…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.81,0:20:37.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dokter Domon! Putraku jatuh dari pohon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.15,0:20:42.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku berjanji akan membayarmu nanti.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.45,0:20:43.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.53,0:20:45.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau tidak perlu membayarku.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.66,0:20:46.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mari kita lihat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.62,0:20:50.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tulangnya tampaknya tidak patah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.87,0:20:53.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi lecetnya parah dan dia berdarah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.21,0:20:56.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku akan mengoleskan obat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.17,0:21:01.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia akan baik-baik saja besok.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.93,0:21:06.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Shobo!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.30,0:21:07.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau sudah bisa berlari?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.72,0:21:10.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dokter Domon mengobatiku.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.36,0:21:21.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.15,0:21:23.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tak bisa menggerakkan kakiku.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.49,0:21:25.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Cepat, Shobo!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.95,0:21:26.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tunggu!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.49,0:21:31.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Biar kulihat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.21,0:21:41.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Astaga…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.46,0:21:43.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tanahnya memakan dagingnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.30,0:21:47.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jimat terkutuknya…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.97,0:21:49.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Otoya.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.93,0:21:51.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya, Tuan Mao.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.15,0:22:02.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini bernanah dengan racun miasma!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.03,0:22:09.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Semua akan baik-baik saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.62,0:22:17.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia akan baik-baik saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.05,0:22:31.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku berhasil membuang\Nracun miasmanya, tapi…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.97,0:22:33.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Obat Tanah ini
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.77,0:22:35.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dibuat oleh seorang amatir.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.14,0:22:39.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini bukan ulah onmyoji.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.77,0:22:44.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada apa, Yae?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.57,0:22:45.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau sakit?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.61,0:22:48.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh… Aku harus bergegas.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.16,0:22:52.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dokter Domon, bukan?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.87,0:22:59.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia pria tua.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.13,0:23:03.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak pernah ada orang seperti dia\Ndi antara penyihir Tanah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.59,0:23:06.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Siapa kau?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.72,0:24:40.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pengobatanmu menggunakan tanah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.31,0:24:44.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukankah itu awalnya diajarkan kepadamu\Noleh orang lain?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.40,0:24:47.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau tahu sesuatu tentang ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.03,0:24:50.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tentang orang itu?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.24,0:24:52.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Orang itu?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.78,0:24:55.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa yang kau tahu?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.64,0:25:16.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selanjutnya, "Natsuno".
